{
  "family": "ubnf",
  "section": "ルール本体の書き方 / リテラル",
  "summary": "リテラルの綴りとエスケープ展開。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "literal/single-quoted",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "シングルクォートで囲んだ文字列はそのまま照合します："
      },
      "input": "grammar G { LetKeyword ::= 'let' ; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"let\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "literal/double-quoted-rejected",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "TerminalElement ::= \"'\" chars \"'\""
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= \"x\"; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "reject"
      },
      "note": "終端要素はシングルクォートでのみ綴られる。"
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/newline",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "| `'\\n'` | 改行 |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\n'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"\\n\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/tab",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "| `'\\t'` | タブ |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\t'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"\\t\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/carriage-return",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "| `'\\r'` | 復帰 |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\r'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"\\r\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/backslash",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "| `'\\\\'` | バックスラッシュ |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\\\'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"\\\\\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/single-quote",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "| `'\\''` | シングルクォート |"
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\''; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "accept",
        "canonicalContains": [
          "[\"TerminalElement\",\"'\"]"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/unknown-sequence",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## ルール本体の書き方",
        "sentence": "**エスケープシーケンス** も使えます："
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= '\\q'; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "undetermined",
        "question": "表は `\\n` `\\t` `\\r` `\\\\` `\\'` の 5 つだけを挙げ、表に無いエスケープ （例 `\\q`）を拒否するのか、バックスラッシュごと残すのか、`q` にするのかを述べていない。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "escape/unterminated-literal",
      "scope": "parse",
      "citation": {
        "file": "unlaxer-dsl/specs/ubnf-syntax.md",
        "heading": "## 形式的な文法定義",
        "sentence": "TerminalElement ::= \"'\" chars \"'\""
      },
      "input": "grammar G { R ::= 'x; }",
      "expectation": {
        "verdict": "reject"
      }
    }
  ]
}
